### Upload while PendingVerification — EXPECTED: 409 (submitted evidence is frozen)
# Result: PASS (409; driver S4-23). Decision D4: uploads are allowed only in Draft or
# Rejected. After submit there is no re-open transition, so allowing an upload would
# silently change the evidence an Admin is asked to verify.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lands/{{landId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{landlordToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentTypeId": 2, "filePath": "docs/encumbrance-001.pdf" }

